Preserved learning projects
---------------------------

  AuthHub/
  heang-api-center/
  heang-dev-lab/
  spring-boot-lab/

These predate the harness and are kept for historical reference. They were
written while following tutorials, courses and framework documentation, so
parts of them derive from third-party material. Granting an MIT licence over
this repository does not transfer rights the author never held: those
directories retain whatever terms their original sources carry, and anyone
reusing code from them should check the original source rather than relying
on the licence at the root of this repository.

Nothing from these directories is published by the console. A test asserts
that the rendered catalogue contains no reference to them, and .vercelignore
keeps them out of any deployment upload.

